<title>NEW ZEALAND: Bank of NZ to cut NZ 1 yr fixed rate to 8.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Bank of NZ to cut NZ 1 yr fixed rate to 8.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of New Zealand Ltd said on Wednesday it would cut its one year fixed housing mortage rate to 8.70 percent from 8.95 percent, effective May 12.</p>
<p>It would also cut its one-year fixed farming rate to 8.95 percent from 9.25 percent.</p>
<p>The bank said the changes were in response to falls in wholesale rates and therefore the cost of funding.</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom (64-4-4734746)</p>
